# JQUERY BASICS 1

## 1. Write a jQuery to check the contents of the elements on button click.
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Basic jQuery</title>

    <script src="jquery-3.6.1.min.js"></script>

    <script>
        $(document).ready(function () {
