</head>

<body>
    <p>Romal Shah: 239720</p>

    <button id="b1">Hide</button>
    <button id="b2">Show</button>
</body>
</html>
```

OUTPUT:
Click Hide → paragraph disappears with animation.
Click Show → paragraph appears with animation.

